 {'document':'IRM-20 specification 2025-11-21','url':'https://www.meanwell.com/Upload/PDF/IRM-20-SPEC.PDF','cache':str(spec.relative_to(R)),'sha256':sha(spec),'pages':3,'read':'p1 PCB-mount intended use; p3 mechanical drawing and installation-manual referral','literal_excerpts':['ready to be soldered onto the PCB boards','3.5±1mm'],'finding':'Mating PCB construction is intended; pin length2.5..4.5mm and body general +/-0.5mm are explicit. Potted/ClassII/noFG/component approvals do not supply reduced unit-to-system distances. No alternative permitted tight-enclosure construction found.'},
